</style></div><main class="main-wrapper"><section class="section_hero background-color-grey"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small border-left"><div id="w-node-_432db532-800d-a91b-3775-9ec7751f8a81-c3d44bf9" class="hero-heading-wrapper"><div class="max-width-large _720"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="heading-eyebrow">Private Markets</div></div><h1 class="heading-large-h2">LTSE Private Markets for  Late-Stage Companies</h1><div class="spacer-small"></div><p>Raise Capital. Protect Your Mission. Build for the Long Term.</p><div class="flex-vertical gap-32 align-left"><div class="max-width-medium"></div><a href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" data-wf-native-id-path="84239198-cc73-3cc8-0ec5-366f292468c6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="84239198-cc73-3cc8-0ec5-366f292468c6" class="button w-button">Request More Information</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hero-cutout-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/69034039b208c978a339d1b8_Group%2010129007.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hero-cutout"/></div></section><section class="section_marketcontent"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="marketcontent_component"><div class="heading-eyebrow">LTSE for Late-Stage Companies</div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="marketcontent-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 148 80" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M147.402 39.8418L104.514 79.1172L104.514 65.8086L92.7471 65.8086L92.7471 13.8789L104.516 13.8789L104.516 0.567389L147.402 39.8418Z" fill="#46A65E" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<rect x="88.8105" y="13.8789" width="51.9309" height="26.8987" transform="rotate(90 88.8105 13.8789)" fill="#8DBF93" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<rect x="57.9829" y="13.8789" width="51.9309" height="26.8987" transform="rotate(90 57.9829 13.8789)" fill="#BDDAC1" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.5"/>
<rect x="27.1487" y="13.8789" width="51.9309" height="26.8987" transform="rotate(90 27.1487 13.8789)" fill="#ECFDEE" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.5"/>
</svg></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><h2>Build a legacy of long-term value with investors who share your vision.</h2><div class="spacer-medium"></div><p>LTSE Private Markets connects <span class="text-weight-semibold">late-stage private companies</span> with long-term investors who share their vision for sustainable growth. Through both <span class="text-weight-semibold">primary</span> and <span class="text-weight-semibold">secondary</span> transactions, companies can raise growth capital, support employee liquidity, or prepare for a strategic <span class="text-weight-semibold">exit — all</span> with less short-term pressure.<br/><br/>We work with a <span class="text-weight-semibold">global community of long-term institutional investors</span> representing over <span class="text-weight-semibold">$40 billion in assets under management (AUM)</span>. Each aligns with LTSE’s long-term principles, so you can raise capital confident that your stakeholders, strategy, and governance are in sync.</p><div class="spacer-medium"></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="482654a2-e1e5-f211-7364-38afa74deb86" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="482654a2-e1e5-f211-7364-38afa74deb86" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="marketcontent-item-header is-button w-inline-block"><p>Learn How LTSE Private Markets Works</p><div class="icon-embed-small is-arrow w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 33 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<circle cx="16.4949" cy="16.4949" r="16" fill="#FEFF69" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.989583"/>
<path d="M22.387 16.8484C22.5823 16.6532 22.5823 16.3366 22.387 16.1413L19.205 12.9593C19.0098 12.7641 18.6932 12.7641 18.4979 12.9593C18.3027 13.1546 18.3027 13.4712 18.4979 13.6664L21.3263 16.4949L18.4979 19.3233C18.3027 19.5186 18.3027 19.8351 18.4979 20.0304C18.6932 20.2257 19.0098 20.2257 19.205 20.0304L22.387 16.8484ZM22.0334 16.4949L22.0334 15.9949L10.9565 15.9949L10.9565 16.4949L10.9565 16.9949L22.0334 16.9949L22.0334 16.4949Z" fill="#161616"/>
</svg></div></a><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="line-divider-horizontal"></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Connecting Mission-Driven Investors with Long-Term Companies</h3><div class="spacer-medium"></div><ul role="list" class="market-list-wrapper"><li class="market-list-item"><span class="text-weight-semibold">The Long-Term Stock Exchange</span> is an SEC-registered national securities exchange that revolutionized listing principles and prioritizes companies’ long-term vision.</li></ul><ul role="list" class="market-list-wrapper"><li class="market-list-item">Affiliated with the  Long-Term Stock Exchange,<span class="text-weight-semibold"> LTSE Private Markets</span> is the platform where mission-driven growth companies raise capital from long-term, aligned investors.</li></ul><ul role="list" class="market-list-wrapper"><li class="market-list-item">Together, we are redefining how leading private companies access capital, structure governance, and prepare for liquidity events or an IPO.</li></ul><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="button-group"><a data-wf-native-id-path="632e8128-6bc5-23bd-1dcc-d240901604de" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="632e8128-6bc5-23bd-1dcc-d240901604de" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="button w-button">Join the LTSE Private Markets Network</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section border-top padded background-color-grey"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h4 class="text-align-center">Built on Institutional Credibility</h4></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><div class="text-align-center">LTSE is backed by some of the world’s leading investors</div></div></div></div><div class="marquee-horizontal_wrapper"><div class="marquee-horizontal_panel"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/67a3bdff18c233adef237aaf_Obvious-Logo-png.png" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/67a3bdff18c233adef237aaf_Obvious-Logo-png-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/67a3bdff18c233adef237aaf_Obvious-Logo-png-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/67a3bdff18c233adef237aaf_Obvious-Logo-png.png 1113w" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3ceaa69fc7cc7cfbdc71_Andreessen%20Horowitz-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3613eca90d4c739d67b5_Greylock_Partners_logo.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6760e26edb332cd60a2e3197_collab%20fund%20logo.png" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6760e26edb332cd60a2e3197_collab%20fund%20logo-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6760e26edb332cd60a2e3197_collab%20fund%20logo-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6760e26edb332cd60a2e3197_collab%20fund%20logo.png 1185w" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3ce8c09380bc618c537a_founders-fund-logo-vector-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3d8fa251ce532f17b187_Vector-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3 hide"/></div><div class="marquee-horizontal_panel"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/67a23903c8c70bb995a9a846_main-logo-black.webp" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3ceaa69fc7cc7cfbdc71_Andreessen%20Horowitz-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="