png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6760e26edb332cd60a2e3197_collab%20fund%20logo.png 1185w" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3ce8c09380bc618c537a_founders-fund-logo-vector-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/675c3d8fa251ce532f17b187_Vector-cropped.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="image-3 hide"/></div></div></section><section class="section_investortable"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="heading-wrapper"><h2>What LTSE Private Markets Does for <br/>Late-Stage Companies</h2></div></div></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="investortable_component"><div class="table-column"><div class="table-header is-blue is-investor is-green"><h4>Primary<br/>Transactions</h4></div><div class="table-cell is-investor"><div class="investor-table-item"><p>Raise growth capital from aligned investors who understand your long-term strategy.</p><a data-wf-native-id-path="7ecead0f-c45b-be47-ba76-a0dfae31c1a8" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="7ecead0f-c45b-be47-ba76-a0dfae31c1a8" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="investor-table-header w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-b0f16493-dc35-b4ee-3a97-0bc80af1adca-c3d44bf9">Request a Capital Strategy Consultation</div><div id="w-node-b55e7b22-87f2-c453-ba1f-834e48998a25-c3d44bf9" class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 33 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<circle cx="16.4949" cy="16.4949" r="16" fill="#FEFF69" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.989583"/>
<path d="M22.387 16.8484C22.5823 16.6532 22.5823 16.3366 22.387 16.1413L19.205 12.9593C19.0098 12.7641 18.6932 12.7641 18.4979 12.9593C18.3027 13.1546 18.3027 13.4712 18.4979 13.6664L21.3263 16.4949L18.4979 19.3233C18.3027 19.5186 18.3027 19.8351 18.4979 20.0304C18.6932 20.2257 19.0098 20.2257 19.205 20.0304L22.387 16.8484ZM22.0334 16.4949L22.0334 15.9949L10.9565 15.9949L10.9565 16.4949L10.9565 16.9949L22.0334 16.9949L22.0334 16.4949Z" fill="#161616"/>
</svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="table-column"><div class="table-header is-blue is-investor is-green"><h4>Secondary<br/>Transactions</h4></div><div class="table-cell is-investor"><div class="investor-table-item"><p>Provide structured liquidity to founders, early investors, and employees.</p><a data-wf-native-id-path="143ce2a1-1476-9f0f-10c5-d0ee0a938792" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="143ce2a1-1476-9f0f-10c5-d0ee0a938792" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="investor-table-header w-inline-block"><div>Design a Founder or Employee Liquidity Program</div><div id="w-node-_143ce2a1-1476-9f0f-10c5-d0ee0a938795-c3d44bf9" class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 33 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<circle cx="16.4949" cy="16.4949" r="16" fill="#FEFF69" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.989583"/>
<path d="M22.387 16.8484C22.5823 16.6532 22.5823 16.3366 22.387 16.1413L19.205 12.9593C19.0098 12.7641 18.6932 12.7641 18.4979 12.9593C18.3027 13.1546 18.3027 13.4712 18.4979 13.6664L21.3263 16.4949L18.4979 19.3233C18.3027 19.5186 18.3027 19.8351 18.4979 20.0304C18.6932 20.2257 19.0098 20.2257 19.205 20.0304L22.387 16.8484ZM22.0334 16.4949L22.0334 15.9949L10.9565 15.9949L10.9565 16.4949L10.9565 16.9949L22.0334 16.9949L22.0334 16.4949Z" fill="#161616"/>
</svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="table-column"><div class="table-header is-blue is-investor is-green"><h4>Governance<br/>Advisory</h4></div><div class="table-cell is-investor"><div class="investor-table-item"><p>Adopt best practices for your board and executive team to strengthen oversight and alignment.</p><a data-wf-native-id-path="e0db3897-f686-a12d-dede-295c1ddcea1b" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e0db3897-f686-a12d-dede-295c1ddcea1b" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="investor-table-header w-inline-block"><div>Strengthen Your Governance Framework</div><div id="w-node-e0db3897-f686-a12d-dede-295c1ddcea1e-c3d44bf9" class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 33 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<circle cx="16.4949" cy="16.4949" r="16" fill="#FEFF69" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.989583"/>
