</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section bordered top-only"><div class="padding-global nullify-mobile"><div class="container-large"><div class="heading-wrapper"><div class="heading-eyebrow">principles THAT SET VISIONARY COMPANIES APART </div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><h2>5 differentiated principles that drive long-term value</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="section bordered"><div class="padding-global nullify-mobile"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-5col border-bottom"><div id="w-node-_3a485bdf-a5b7-e8f2-d6bf-3bc632a66556-c3d44bf9" class="grid-cell-steps is-first"><div><div class="icon-embed-medium w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 44 41" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
