<ellipse cx="7.73238" cy="7.7322" rx="7.73238" ry="7.7322" transform="matrix(3.80356e-08 -1 -1 -4.97812e-08 15.9644 15.9648)" fill="#46A65E" stroke="#3F3F3F"/>
</svg></div><div class="marketcontent-item-header"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Founder-Centric Approach</h3><p>We work as an extended part of your executive team - ensuring transactions and strategic advice always serve the company’s long-term mission.</p></div></div><div class="marketcontent-item"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<ellipse cx="7.73238" cy="7.7322" rx="7.73238" ry="7.7322" transform="matrix(3.80356e-08 -1 -1 -4.97812e-08 15.9644 15.9648)" fill="#8DBF93" stroke="#3F3F3F"/>
</svg></div><div class="marketcontent-item-header"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Long-Term Investors</h3><p>Access to Long-Term Investors focused on sustainable growth, not short-term returns (Single and Multi-Family Offices, Endowments &amp; Foundations, Impact-driven VC funds across the world).</p></div></div><div class="marketcontent-item"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<ellipse cx="7.73238" cy="7.7322" rx="7.73238" ry="7.7322" transform="matrix(3.80356e-08 -1 -1 -4.97812e-08 15.9644 15.9648)" fill="#BDDAC1" stroke="#3F3F3F"/>
</svg></div><div class="marketcontent-item-header"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Trusted Platform</h3><p>As part of the Long-Term Stock Exchange ecosystem, we bring credibility, regulatory understanding, and a governance-first mindset - ensuring every transaction enhances your company’s reputation.</p></div></div><div class="marketcontent-item"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<ellipse cx="7.73238" cy="7.7322" rx="7.73238" ry="7.7322" transform="matrix(3.80356e-08 -1 -1 -4.97812e-08 15.9644 15.9648)" fill="#DEEDE0" stroke="#3F3F3F"/>
</svg></div><div class="marketcontent-item-header"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Efficient Execution</h3><p>We execute transactions with transparency, efficiency, and with minimal disruption to your business.</p></div></div><div class="marketcontent-item"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<ellipse cx="7.73238" cy="7.7322" rx="7.73238" ry="7.7322" transform="matrix(3.80356e-08 -1 -1 -4.97812e-08 15.9644 15.9648)" fill="#DEEDE0" stroke="#3F3F3F"/>
</svg></div><div class="marketcontent-item-header"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Investment Grade Advisory</h3><p>We can also help you think through governance, capital structuring and IPO readiness.</p></div></div><div class="marketcontent-item is-last"><a data-wf-native-id-path="bcd80ee2-ff43-6814-117f-9f9fe7db4072" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="bcd80ee2-ff43-6814-117f-9f9fe7db4072" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="marketcontent-item-header is-button w-inline-block"><p>Request a Confidential Discussion with LTSE Private Markets</p><div class="icon-embed-small is-arrow w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 33 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<circle cx="16.4949" cy="16.4949" r="16" fill="#FEFF69" stroke="#161616" stroke-width="0.989583"/>
