</svg></div><h4>Companies exploring an IPO on a U.S. Exchange</h4></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bordered background-color-grey border-top-none"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="marketcontent-item is-last"></div></div></div></div><section class="section_ctawithimage"><div class="w-layout-grid ctawithimage_component"><div class="ctawithimage_left"><div class="ctawithimage_image-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/695e04befad07eb1688328ff_f63d7a7b87e733781983105de43cb5fcd5fcc491.png" loading="eager" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 898px) 100vw, 898px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/695e04befad07eb1688328ff_f63d7a7b87e733781983105de43cb5fcd5fcc491-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/695e04befad07eb1688328ff_f63d7a7b87e733781983105de43cb5fcd5fcc491-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/695e04befad07eb1688328ff_f63d7a7b87e733781983105de43cb5fcd5fcc491.png 1006w" class="ctawithimage_image"/></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><p class="text-weight-semibold">Shahnawaz Malik</p><div class="spacer-small"></div><div>Head of Private Markets, Capital Markets Advisory</div></div><div id="w-node-b2dac0f6-c37a-dbe2-f557-8f89d434f6f4-d434f6f0" class="padding-section-large is-ctaimagewrapper"><div class="ctawithimage_content"><h2>Speak with the LTSE Private Markets Team</h2><div class="spacer-large"></div><p>LTSE Private Markets works with late-stage private companies to strengthen governance, engage aligned long-term investors, and support durable growth  on your company’s own timeline.</p><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="button-group"><a href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" data-wf-native-id-path="0556d13e-5311-1b20-afc2-162934bf23cd:b2dac0f6-c37a-dbe2-f557-8f89d434f702" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="b2dac0f6-c37a-dbe2-f557-8f89d434f702" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22b2dac0f6-c37a-dbe2-f557-8f89d434f6f0%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%220556d13e-5311-1b20-afc2-162934bf23cd%22%7D%5D" class="button is-white w-button">Request a Confidential Discussion</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="heading-wrapper"><h2>LTSE Private Markets FAQs for Late-Stage Companies</h2></div></div></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-bottom padding-section-large"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What size companies do you typically work with? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We focus on late-stage mission-driven growth companies, typically Series C+ (though this isn&#x27;t a hard requirement).</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>Can you help with smaller liquidity needs? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>While we typically focus on transactions of $10M+, we can often help design tender offer programs or other structures for smaller liquidity needs. </p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>Do we need to be considering an LTSE listing to work with you? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>No. While we believe LTSE&#x27;s principles benefit many companies, there&#x27;s no requirement or expectation to list on LTSE.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>How do you source your investor network? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We&#x27;ve cultivated relationships with institutional investors who specifically seek access to high-quality private companies in mission-driven companies. These relationships come from the broader LTSE ecosystem.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What&#x27;s your typical engagement timeline? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>Secondary transactions typically close in 60-90 days. Primary raises take 90-180 days. Advisory engagements are usually 6-12 months with the option to extend. We&#x27;re flexible based on your needs and timeline.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>How is your fee structure different from traditional investment banks? </h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We operate as a principal, not a broker-dealer, which gives us more flexibility in fee structures. We&#x27;re happy to discuss specific fee structures based on scope.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What if we&#x27;re not ready for your services today?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We&#x27;re happy to stay in touch and be a resource as you grow. Many of our best relationships began with early conversations that led to engagements 12-24 months later.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What type of opportunities are available?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>Investors can participate in both <strong>secondary transactions</strong> via an SPV structure and/or <strong>primary raises</strong>. The platform focuses on late-stage, high-quality private companies often on a trajectory toward an IPO or other liquidity events.</p><p>‍</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What differentiates LTSE’s access?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>LTSE’s relationships with private companies stem from our Silicon Valley roots and governance advisory work. This direct corporate engagement provides early visibility into capital needs and strategic intentions.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What kind of investors participate?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We work with mission-driven investors ranging from endowments, foundations, family offices, and select fund managers.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What fees apply?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>Fees vary by transaction type but are typically deal-based rather than fund-based, ensuring alignment and transparency. Advisory or structuring fees may apply in certain cases.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>How do investors stay informed post-transaction?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>We provide periodic updates, company performance insights, and governance developments for ongoing transparency.</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What size of investment or commitment are expected?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>Opportunities range widely from sub-$1 million secondary allocations to larger structured transactions in the $5 million to $20 million range. </p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="faq-wrapper is-first"><div id="q1" class="faq-question-wrapper"><h5>What is the LTSE Private Markets Investor Network?</h5><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="faq-icon" data-w-id="12099837-9124-ffb9-fc3e-6717487d5c18" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/64634b51cc057db292660f2a_plus-to-minus-faq-ltse.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div><div class="faq-content-wrapper"><div class="faq-text w-richtext"><p>A curated network for mission-driven investors to learn and share ideas. The network is not a pooled fund. Investors choose which opportunities to participate in, allowing for flexibility, transparency and control. </p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6463483586d11debe867a80f_FAQ%20Border.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="full-image"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="button-group is-center"><a data-wf-native-id-path="032c96ac-ba7c-1111-bbcd-d7e99f4c28e9" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="032c96ac-ba7c-1111-bbcd-d7e99f4c28e9" href="/contact-private-markets-for-late-stage-companies" class="button w-button">Schedule a Private Consultation with LTSE Private Markets</a></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div></div></div></div></div></main></div><footer clas